flowchart TD
    start([Feature proposed]) --> capture[Capture request from conversation or configured tracker]
%% @airflow-context capture
%% Accept a feature proposal from the conversation or the configured GitHub/GitLab
%% tracker. The tracker is optional. Do not start implementation or select a
%% release during intake.
%%
%% Feature transitions owned by this phase:
%% - `proposed` -> `clarifying`: AI captures and refines the proposal.
%% - `backlog` -> `deferred`: Human defers; existing Definition approval remains valid.
%% - `deferred` -> `backlog`: Human reopens and existing Definition approval is still valid.
%% - `deferred` / `rejected` -> `proposed`: Human reopens with no valid Definition approval; preserve decisions and use `record_status: draft`.
%%
%% New features start proposed. Active states: proposed, clarifying, backlog,
%% selected, implementing, verifying, verified. Deferred/rejected need explicit
%% reopening. Released is terminal; later changes use a new feature ID.
%% @end-airflow-context
    capture --> clarify[Clarify problem, users, outcome, scope and non-goals]
%% @airflow-context clarify
%% Ask only for information needed to write a useful Definition: affected users,
%% problem, expected outcome/value, scope and non-goals. Do not infer missing
%% requirements. Keep this proposal under one stable feature ID in `.air/`.
%% @end-airflow-context
    clarify --> ready{Enough information to prepare a Definition draft?}
    ready -- No: ask and refine --> clarify
    ready -- Yes: create or update draft --> draft[Draft feature Definition in `.air/features/F-0001/definition.md`]
    draft --> definition[["Definition: definition.mmd"]]
    definition -- Blocked --> blocked([Blocked: await missing decision])
    definition -- Approved: add to `.air/index.md` backlog --> backlog[Feature in approved backlog]
    definition -- Deferred: update `.air/index.md` --> deferred[Feature deferred]
    definition -- Rejected: record decision --> rejected[Feature rejected]
    backlog --> another{Process another proposal now?}
    deferred --> another
    rejected --> another
    another -- Yes --> capture
    another -- No --> anyApproved{Any approved features in backlog?}
    anyApproved -- Yes --> intakeReady([Approved backlog ready for release planning])
    anyApproved -- No --> noApproved([No approved feature: pause project])

    classDef boundary fill:#126a52,color:#ffffff,stroke:#126a52
    class start,intakeReady,noApproved boundary
    classDef approval fill:#fff0e8,color:#633b2c,stroke:#c68162
    class ready,another,anyApproved approval
